==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Kricketune|4}} from the {{TCG|Next Destinies}} expansion.
**[[Castelia City]] from {{game3|Black and White|Pokémon Black, White|s}}, {{B2W2|Black 2, and White 2}} is featured in the background of the illustration.
*'''Entrancing Melody''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Triumphant|Kricketune|24}} from the {{TCG|Triumphant}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

